---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us - Redefining Audio Extraction | Saver For TUBE"
  description="Discover the story behind Saver For TUBE: our mission to provide the fastest, cleanest, and most reliable 320kbps YouTube to MP3 audio converter without popups or software installs."
  canonicalUrl="https://saverfortube.com/about-us"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-16">
    
    <!-- 1. Hero Header & Brand Identity -->
    <div class="space-y-4 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900/60">
        About Our Platform
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Redefining Online Audio Extraction with Speed, Fidelity &amp; Privacy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        The story behind Saver For TUBE and our uncompromising commitment to building the cleanest, safest, and most technologically advanced web-based YouTube to MP3 converter in 2026.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 5. Key Metrics / Stats Counter Row -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900/80 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center space-y-1">
        <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-mono">320 kbps</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Studio Audio Fidelity</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Uncompromised acoustic clarity</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900/80 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center space-y-1">
        <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-mono">&lt; 3 Sec</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Avg. Transcoding Time</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Real-time edge server clusters</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900/80 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center space-y-1">
        <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-mono">100% Free</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">No Hidden Paywalls</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Unlimited daily conversions</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900/80 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center space-y-1">
        <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-mono">0 Installs</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Zero Software Needed</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Pure browser-native execution</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. The Origin Story: Why We Built Saver For TUBE -->
    <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-5">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
        Our Story
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">
        The Origin Story: Why We Built Saver For TUBE
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          For over a decade, the online audio conversion space has been plagued by deceptive user experiences. Millions of everyday students, music enthusiasts, language learners, and podcast listeners searching for simple audio tools were forced to navigate a hostile web landscape: confusing multi-layered fake download buttons, push notification traps, intrusive pop-under redirects, crypto-mining scripts, and artificial queues designed to force paid subscriptions.
        </p>
        <p>
          We believed internet users deserved fundamentally better. In early 2026, our team of passionate software engineers and audio processing enthusiasts came together with a clear ambition: <strong>build a modern, ad-clean, and software-free media utility</strong> that puts digital privacy and acoustic fidelity first.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Saver For TUBE</strong> was engineered from the ground up as a cloud-native platform that eliminates the clutter of legacy converter sites. By utilizing isolated, multi-threaded transcoding nodes, we deliver crystal-clear audio extraction in seconds—completely free of deceptive advertisements, intrusive tracking, or required software installations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Our Mission & Vision -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/60 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Our Mission</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          To empower individuals worldwide with frictionless, uncompromised audio extraction tools for lawful personal, educational, and creative study—making knowledge, public domain lectures, and sound archives universally portable.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/60 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Our Vision</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          To set the global benchmark for web-based media transcoding where exceptional audio fidelity, uncompromising cybersecurity, and clean minimalist user interface design operate in perfect harmony.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. Core Architectural Pillars (Grid of 4 Key Cards) -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">
          Our Four Core Engineering Pillars
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          The foundational principles that power every conversion on Saver For TUBE.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- Pillar 1 -->
        <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/60 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12-3c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zM9 10l12-3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">1. Audiophile-Grade Sound (320 kbps)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Our high-precision FFmpeg pipeline isolates native Opus and AAC audio streams from source videos and transcodes them up to 320 kbps without multi-pass compression loss, clipping, or dynamic range attenuation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 2 -->
        <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/60 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">2. Privacy-First &amp; Ephemeral Model</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            We store zero permanent files on our servers. Transcoding occurs in volatile RAM memory buffers that are instantly destroyed the second your download finishes, ensuring complete user privacy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 3 -->
        <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/60 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">3. Lightning Cloud Transcoding</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Multi-threaded cloud server clusters process short clips, trending YouTube Shorts, or multi-hour academic lectures in under 3 seconds without artificial wait times or rate throttling.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 4 -->
        <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/60 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">4. Universal Device Compatibility</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Engineered with a responsive, browser-native framework that performs flawlessly across macOS, Windows PC, iOS (iPhone/iPad), Android, Linux, and all major desktop and mobile browsers.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 6. Ethical Commitment & Copyright Responsibility -->
    <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400">⚖️</span> Ethical Commitment &amp; Legal Responsibility
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
        Saver For TUBE operates as an independent web application dedicated to advancing lawful fair use, digital accessibility, and educational research. We strictly respect the intellectual property rights of artists, producers, and content owners.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Disclaimer of Affiliation:</strong> YouTube, YouTube Shorts, and Google are registered trademarks of Google LLC. Saver For TUBE is an independent utility and is not endorsed by, sponsored by, or affiliated with Google LLC or YouTube.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 7. Call-to-Action (CTA) Banner -->
    <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12 text-center space-y-5">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Experience Studio-Quality Audio Conversion Today
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Join thousands of students, researchers, and audiophiles who rely on Saver For TUBE for clean, fast, and secure audio extraction.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm text-white bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 dark:bg-red-500 dark:hover:bg-red-600 transition-colors"
        >
          <span>Start Converting Now</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-200 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 transition-colors border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700"
        >
          <span>Contact Our Team</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
